 "officials": {
  "_comment": "Clash kits (src/clash_kits.c), [base, var] (var 0 = the base colour): the keepers' own colour, and the colours a keeper / the referee may change to when a team is too alike, in order: the first apart from both teams' shirts (the referee's from the keepers' too) is taken, failing all any colour. The keepers' own dark green has to be further apart than that (keeper_default_apart: a small figure's shirt shows its lightness better than its hue, and dark green beside azure or steel blue looked too alike); failing that, anthracite, emerald, lime, silver, as tiers of one. The referee's own is black.",
  "keeper_default": [8, 6, "dark green"],
  "keeper_default_apart": 46,
  "keeper": [
   [[2, 1, "anthracite"]],
   [[8, 5, "emerald"]],
